{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id991409039"}, "name":{"label":"melvin love"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-25T20:16:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.42"}, "id":{"label":"14712129811"}, "title":{"label":"Scary surroundings"}, "content":{"label":"The hotel was attached to a parking garage that was a haven for vagrants. No safety measures. Also there was a horrible smell of pee in there and the elevator entrance to get to the top floors of the garage we’re not even accessible. The rooms carpet was stained, the water would not go down the drain while showering and the water was not hot.  The room was out dated but clean. The hallways were half painted or primed white over blue. It was just terrible. Also there was an armed guard with an AR in the lobby screening those who entered. Don’t bring your kids there!!!! Never going back!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=427916203&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
