{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id656388058"}, "name":{"label":"Luve88"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-25T17:10:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.42"}, "id":{"label":"14711668783"}, "title":{"label":"Do not stay in suite 201"}, "content":{"label":"The room was beautiful but smelled like mildew. The blanket was stained. Cracks in the ceiling and stains in the floor. The fridge was was not working properly. The freezer part was frozen with a big block of ice. I talked to the property person/manager via text. I told them that I had a 2 month old, who is breastfeeding. The milk needs to be refrigerated and the cool packs needs to be frozen in order to keep the milk cool while out. They had a cleaning service come over. All they did was take a blanket out the closet, removed the stained blanket and put that one on. They sprayed the stains on the floor to clean it, but the stains are still there. They sent someone to replace the fridge/freezer. They came into the room with out our knowledge. After I told the manager to let me know when they would be here because I was still on the property but not the room. We were never told. The refrigerator that was replaced did not have a freezer and they placed ice in the bathroom sink. We tried calling and did not get an answer. This is by far the worst service I’ve ever encountered. There isn’t a front desk or someone to talk to on the property. FYI, I found out that the room are individually own and then rented out. So other rooms maybe better and upgrade depending on the owner. They refused to give us a refund despite us being unable to stay. The people said that the kickenette described in the description only mentions a refrigerator not a freezer. Thier literal words and although they could not accommodate my breastfeeding daughter needs, I couldn’t get my money refunded. This place is a nightmare.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=427916203&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
