{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id428522541"}, "name":{"label":"Possibly26"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-24T18:00:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.42"}, "id":{"label":"14707600227"}, "title":{"label":"Very big problem"}, "content":{"label":"I have been a valued customer since Expedia opened up for business. Recently I reserved a hotel several months in advance because I am traveling to the USA from overseas. This morning I received a voice mail that I could hardly understand that my reservation was canceled because of a contractual agreement between Expedia and the reserved hotel. This is a notice less than a week from my arrival. No apology and no effort to help me with an alternative booking. Expedia has gone from a first class company to a third world disaster and can not be trusted with my business again.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=427916203&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
