{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id702171165"}, "name":{"label":"ShauerSE"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-24T12:59:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.42"}, "id":{"label":"14706806485"}, "title":{"label":"It’s been a while but looks a lot same!"}, "content":{"label":"My husband and I booked an overnight at AC Golden Nugget, hadn’t stayed in at least 8 years. The decor in our room was exactly the same as 8 years ago so a bit dated and dark but clean and besides a broken lamp well kept.\nBathroom was clean and fresh and shower was great.\nBed was well broken in and could use a new mattress. \nHappy Hour dinner at the chart house was awesome!\nOverall the staff were friendly and welcoming. B+", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=427916203&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
