{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id43980263"}, "name":{"label":"arthaven"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-24T10:18:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.42"}, "id":{"label":"14706289340"}, "title":{"label":"Aitport shuttle menu difficult to find"}, "content":{"label":"I have just spent over an hour inside my account with my trip continually popping up and not being able to book a shuttle from my flight to my hotel. It’s very frustrating. I tried AI help. useless “go book a new trip”. I tried to chat window. I tried cars. I tried packages. I tried things to do. At the top of the car menu, it should allow ground transportation from airport not only rentals! app is good for flights and hotel search but not necessary transfers. Or when you search please let us actually put in a word ! and not give you six choices none of which is what I need to search for. fix this.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=427916203&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
